<title>FRANCE: Block of 1.24 million Axa shares traded.</title>
<headline>Block of 1.24 million Axa shares traded.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>A block of 1.24 million shares in Axa-UAP, representing 0.4 percent of the insurance group's capital, was traded at 0914 GMT on Monday at 366 francs per share, the French stockmarkets association SBF said in a statement.</p>
<p>Shares in Axa were up 0.55 percent at 367 francs at 1125 GMT.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
